        "text": "Managing a diversified portfolio also requires more time and research. To invest soundly, you should understand what you are buying. With a large portfolio, the chances of understanding everything decrease if your portfolio is across different blockchains. You may also need to use multiple wallets and exchanges to access your assets. The decision to diversify or not is yours. It depends on your risk profile and investment style, but some diversification is always recommended. Aside from diversifying your portfolio across different types of coins and tokens, you can also consider using crypto financial products to help further diversify your portfolio. You can think of them a bit like investing in ETFs or mutual funds rather than just holding shares. There's a massive amount of products you can invest in across different blockchains and dapps.",
